---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import RazorpayDonate from '../../components/RazorpayDonate.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Education Material — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="GWE NGO India provides educational material like notebooks, pencils, geometric boxes, uniforms and more to children in need."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Education Material</h1>
        <p>Every child deserves education no matter what.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img class="page-image" src="/images/education-material.webp" alt="Educational material support to students in Kurnool district" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          Today, even families from rural areas understand the value of education and hence they
          send their children to schools, also due to our government's initiative, education for
          poor does not cost much. But, children still lack the basic things they need to study.
          Thinking of their futures, GWE NGO India thought of helping them get educated, get the
          basic things they require to study so that every child gets a chance to be the future of
          India.
        </p>
        <p>
          GWE NGO India has been providing educational material like notebooks, pencils, geometric
          boxes, erasers, writing pads, uniforms, etc. to children. We have covered 120 school
          children belonging to dalits, minorities and differentially-abled children. The impact is
          encouraging and dropout of children from school is reducing.
        </p>
        <RazorpayDonate />
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
